N","tr":"biāyātinā","f":["FP","GEN"],"r":14,"l":28,"g":[["بِـَٔ","P","prefix","bi"],["ِـَٔ","N","stem","FP|GEN"],["ايَـٰ","PRON","suffix","PRON:1P"]]},{"i":"7:51:19","a":"يَجْحَدُونَ","t":"they reject","p":"V","tr":"yajḥadūna","f":["IMPF","3MP"],"r":523,"l":730,"g":[["يَجْحَدُ","V","stem","IMPF|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"e":"٥١","v":"7:51"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"7:44","t":"And the companions of Paradise will call out to the companions of the Fire, \"We have already found what our Lord promised us to be true. Have you found what your Lord promised to be true?\" They will say, \"Yes.\" Then an announcer will announce among them, \"The curse of Allāh shall be upon the wrongdoers","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"7:45","t":"Who averted [people] from the way of Allāh and sought to make it [seem] deviant while they were, concerning the Hereafter, disbelievers.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"7:46","t":"And between them will be a partition [i.e., wall], and on [its] elevations are men who recognize all by their mark. And they call out to the companions of Paradise, \"Peace be upon you.\" They have not [yet] entered it, but they long intensely.","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"7:47","t":"And when their eyes are turned toward the companions of the Fire, they say, \"Our Lord, do not place us with the wrongdoing people.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"7:48","t":"And the companions of the Elevations will call to men [within Hell] whom they recognize by their mark, saying, \"Of no avail to you was your gathering and [the fact] that you were arrogant.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"7:49","t":"[Allāh will say], \"Are these the ones whom you [inhabitants of Hell] swore that Allāh would never offer them mercy? Enter Paradise, [O people of the Elevations]. No fear will there be concerning you, nor will you grieve.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"7:50","t":"And the companions of the Fire will call to the companions of Paradise, \"Pour upon us some water or from whatever Allāh has provided you.\" They will say, \"Indeed, Allāh has forbidden them both to the disbelievers","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"7:51","t":"Who took their religion as distraction and amusement and whom the worldly life deluded.\" So today We will forget them just as they forgot the meeting of this Day of theirs and for having rejected Our verses.","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":51,"sd":null}],"juz":8,"hizb":16,"surahs":[7],"sajdah":false}